WEBVTT

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:07.920
<i>The youthful Nobunaga has emerged 
victorious from his battle</i>

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.200
<i>to the death with Shingen.</i>

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:17.300
<i>Defeated, Shingen tried to 
entrust the future of the East</i>

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.960
<i>and his Regalia to Nobunaga,</i>

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>but Caesar, a Western 
warlord, intervened.</i>

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.660
<i>Now, the two Regalia 
have been divided.</i>

00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.190
<i>The Regalia of fire 
has gone to Nobunaga,</i>

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:31.690
<i>and the Regalia of 
wind is with Caesar.</i>

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:37.370
Oda Nobunaga is a coward!

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:34.700
I never thought Nobunaga would win.

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:36.920
Yeah, seriously.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:39.920
And he got one of the Regalia, too.

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:44.130
But you'll get it back, right?

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:46.410
And as a bonus...

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:47.090
What?

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:48.930
You'll get that princess.

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.390
Caesar-sama.

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:56.420
What is it?

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.160
A message for 
Uesugi Kenshin-dono

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:03.290
was found in our lord's belongings.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:05.100
We consulted amongst ourselves

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:07.310
and deemed it should be 
read by you, Caesar-sama.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:18.050
We beg of you to lend us your 
aid to avenge our lord's death.

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:25.760
You not only got Takeda's castle,

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:27.960
but also his advisors' loyalty.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.670
Good job, Caesar.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:34.160
I have Takeda in my grasp.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:36.220
Uesugi may be next...

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:37.840
What?

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:41.260
Lord Shingen lost his 
life to Nobunaga of Oda?

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.040
Is this true?

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:44.120
Yes, my lord.

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:48.830
Ever since Himiko of Yamatai 
bestowed a Regalia upon Nobunaga,

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:53.050
it seems he has been 
gaining momentum.

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:56.860
I was to be the one to 
defeat that giant...

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:58.990
Yet Nobunaga managed the deed?

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:02.320
This is not the only matter of concern.

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:02.960
Speak.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:06.640
Even prior to Lord 
Shingen's passing,

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.820
Takeda's forces had forged 
a secret alliance

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:11.970
with a Westerner 
named Julius Caesar.

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:14.490
Now that Lord Shingen is no more,

00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:16.620
they seem to have 
formed a coalition.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.220
Julius Caesar...

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:26.150
Then you mean to say that 
Takeda was not the one

00:04:26.150 --> 00:04:28.720
responsible for 
Nobukatsu-sama's death?

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:33.490
Before we fought, Lord Shingen and I

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:35.170
discussed the matter, man to man.

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.250
I know this with certainty 
because I have fought him.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:41.220
He was a warrior 
who would never lie.

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:42.240
Then who was it?

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:43.270
Most likely,

00:04:43.270 --> 00:04:45.810
it was an outsider who 
sought to take advantage

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:49.080
of the turmoil over the succession

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:50.930
so that we could be crushed.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:55.500
For now, we should turn our gaze 
not inward, but outward.

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:58.750
Otherwise, the enemy will take 
advantage of our strife.

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:02.390
My betrothed is correct.

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:04.390
Himiko-sama.

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:05.290
Himiko-sama, are you recovered?

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:08.820
Himiko, shouldn't you stay in bed?

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:15.790
The grief of losing Nobuhide-sama 
and Nobukatsu-sama

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:17.770
will never leave my heart.

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:22.740
But there is no point in 
dwelling on what is past.

00:05:23.270 --> 00:05:27.210
What the Oda clan should do 
now is move forward.

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:30.250
That is what my crystal says.

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:33.200
If we must be concerned,

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:35.570
it should be with Caesar, 
who is in Takeda's castle.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:38.480
I cannot fathom that 
one's true intentions.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:50.980
Lord Shingen entrusted the Regalia 
to me so that I might gain dominion.

00:05:51.390 --> 00:05:54.150
If so, I must regain the 
Regalia of wind from Caesar,

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:57.340
no matter what the cost.

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:03.060
Use the resources of Yamatai 
to grant your heart's desire.

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:05.490
I will.

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:08.110
But, this requires more thought.

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:11.190
He is a foe who cannot be 
defeated by force alone.

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:16.160
Besides, Himiko,
 you shouldn't push yourself.

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:18.930
Shouldn't you be resting?

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.430
Don't worry about me.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:23.130
What matters is...

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:24.730
Do not worry.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:27.270
Leave the war to me.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:34.980
Julius Caesar...

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:44.620
Da Vinci-dono.

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:48.090
What manner of man is Julius Caesar?

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:50.280
King Arthur has

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:53.870
the Brothers of the Round Table, 
who have sworn fealty to him.

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:55.860
Caesar is one of them.

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:58.380
What is his goal?

00:06:58.380 --> 00:07:01.350
Yeah, I want to know, too.

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:06.370
He came outta nowhere and 
pulled all kinds of crap.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:08.820
Do the principles of 
integrity, courage,

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:11.730
and benevolence not exist 
on the Star of the West?

00:07:11.730 --> 00:07:14.880
The West has its own 
concept of chivalry.

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.160
Oh?

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:20.350
I bet it's a path full of cowardly, 
underhanded principles.

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:21.990
I believe Caesar came to this planet

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:26.660
on King Arthur's orders, 
in order to investigate it.

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:28.160
Investigate what?

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:29.600
The Regalia?

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.660
Indeed.

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:35.660
The ley lines of this 
planet are far more turbulent

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:37.970
than those of the Star of the West.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.870
He is here to study 
the potential of the

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.050
Regalia that harness 
the ley lines' power.

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:49.120
Furthermore, he is to investigate 
those who can wield the Regalia...

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.890
So that is his purpose?

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:57.840
Yes, to find those who 
can master the Regalia.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:00.960
That is my desire, as well.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:03.200
Tell me more.

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:08.760
I have always believed that Giant 
War Armor must be developed

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:12.440
as a vessel for activating 
Regalia from days of yore.

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:15.930
But my true passion

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:18.680
is to analyze the various powers 
manifested by the Regalia

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:21.450
and the phenomena they cause.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:24.200
Their powers are said

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:28.720
to draw on the quantum fields 
of this star's ley lines.

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:30.980
Depending on the Regalia's 
own characteristics,

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:33.190
their powers manifest unique qualities

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:36.860
such as fire, water, and gravity.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:42.300
In addition, I have found that 
human willpower, choices, and decisions

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:43.500
interact with the quanta.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.640
They can strengthen or 
weaken the Regalia's power

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:51.310
and even alter their very nature.

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:55.060
I have reached a certain conclusion

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:57.840
after studying various 
experiments and battles.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:00.670
There is a strong correlation

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:03.520
between the Regalia's power and the

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:05.630
willpower of the one who wields it.

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:09.810
So, the stronger its wielder,

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:11.960
the more powerful his Regalia?

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:17.890
You must have experienced 
that for yourself

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:20.030
when you fought Shingen-dono, no?

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.150
Himiko-sama's Regalia,

00:09:23.150 --> 00:09:25.980
and Nobunaga's increased potential...

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:29.570
Earlier, you said it is not Caesar,

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:32.080
but King Arthur who reigns 
on the Star of the West?

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:33.980
Yes, I did.

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:36.720
Does he share your beliefs 
about the Regalia?

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:42.190
I have not yet been permitted to 
have an audience with King Arthur,

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:45.330
so this is only speculation,

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:50.100
but I believe His Majesty 
would agree with me.

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:51.890
His decision to send Caesar here,

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:54.200
right as the ley lines of the West

00:09:54.200 --> 00:09:57.010
have begun falling into decline, 
is evidence enough.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:09:59.960
You said "investigate,"

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:03.090
but does that include stealing 
the Regalia, as well?

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:07.520
Well, that is not for me to say.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.530
If I can say one thing:

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:14.520
those who control the Regalia,
 control the world.

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:19.080
It's possible that King Arthur

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:24.050
seeks to control the Eastern 
ley lines himself

00:10:24.050 --> 00:10:26.030
through the Regalia and their users.

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:27.920
So behind Caesar are the

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:29.950
Brothers of the Round Table in the West,

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:32.540
and King Arthur.

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:34.470
All the more reason

00:10:34.470 --> 00:10:39.000
to retrieve the Regalia Shingen 
wished me to have from Caesar.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:46.780
Chief Hiraga, may I have a moment?

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.460
So is this...

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:53.330
You're going to storm 
the Takeda castle?

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:53.930
Yeah.

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:56.870
But the combined forces of Caesar

00:10:56.870 --> 00:10:59.170
and Takeda will put 
us at a disadvantage.

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:00.990
Good point.

00:11:01.530 --> 00:11:03.200
So what is the best strategy?

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:05.440
You're asking me?

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:07.640
Western tactics are 
cowardly, you know.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:10.860
I'm sorry about that.

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:12.560
I'll stop.

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:16.880
I know!

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:18.680
At a time like this, we should bluff!

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:20.010
How about we build a castle

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:23.620
right in front of the 
Takeda forces overnight?

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:26.290
If something like that were possible,
we wouldn't be struggling.

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:30.160
No, it is not such 
an impossible feat.

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:33.630
All right!

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:36.300
Mitsu, you'll direct this operation.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:38.020
Got it.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:40.160
Monkey, I'm counting on you.

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:42.070
You can depend on me!

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:56.950
What's the matter?

00:11:57.660 --> 00:11:59.950
Why are you spacing out?

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:02.010
Oh, it's nothing...

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:04.430
Wait up, Nobu-sama!

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:04.430
What does it mean?

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:06.480
The Savior-King...

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:09.590
Or Nobunaga... will die?

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:11.370
What am I afraid of?

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:13.580
Nobunaga!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:15.340
What?

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:18.800
Are you really going 
to fight Caesar?

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:20.440
Why bring this up now?

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:22.380
But...

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:26.860
It is inevitable.

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:45.610
Regalia of wind,
 calm in the blue skies!

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:46.970
In Venus's name,

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:50.270
appear before me, your new master,

00:12:50.270 --> 00:12:52.480
and grant me power!

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:01.280
Oh, it's not responding.

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:05.210
I can't believe Caesar 
isn't getting his way.

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:07.790
The Regalia of wind isn't half bad!

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:10.790
As I'd suspected, when...

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:14.300
{flashback}I hereby release you 
from our bond of blood.

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:18.800
Serve Oda Nobunaga henceforth.

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:25.990
It seems that, in addition 
to the Regalia of fire,

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:29.010
the Regalia of wind has 
also bonded with Nobunaga.

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:36.720
I shall defeat Nobunaga 
and nullify the existing bond.

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:42.430
Along with the Regalia of wind,
 I will obtain all of his Regalia,

00:13:42.430 --> 00:13:44.490
and the beautiful princess.

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:47.070
Should we report to 
King Arthur about this?

00:13:47.070 --> 00:13:48.710
Oh, should we?

00:13:48.710 --> 00:13:50.500
Maybe we should.

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:56.320
Ah, a prophecy.

00:13:56.320 --> 00:13:58.200
Since we're facing a decisive battle

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:00.030
between Nobunaga and Caesar,

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:02.120
I'm worried about what it could mean.

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:06.650
Prophecies do not necessarily 
show you the future as it must be.

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:10.750
Perhaps the future can be changed, 
depending on your approach?

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:13.980
One could be interpret it 
as the heavens showing you

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:17.090
what path to take, 
through that vision.

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:20.260
But what can <i>I</i> do?

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.980
Upright Ace of Wands.

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:42.780
This signifies a departure on a 
journey toward dreams and ideals,

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.730
to advance full of enthusiasm.

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:48.950
The wand is both a weapon,
 and a staff that will help you.

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:51.970
It can also become a torch 
in the dark of night

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:54.160
to light your way.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:24.920
Ranmaru, what weighs upon you?

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:25.780
What?

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:29.620
You look quite troubled...

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:36.230
as though you face a tiger,
with a wolf closing in behind you.

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:38.520
What? Whose tiger?

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:41.520
It is an idiom we use on this star.

00:15:41.520 --> 00:15:43.950
After one crisis passes, 
another follows.

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:48.010
It is the perfect phrase to express 
the current state of the Oda clan.

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:52.220
But, I still have faith

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:57.690
that my brother will get us 
through this predicament.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:02.890
So, I'd like you to have 
faith in Nobu, as well.

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:14.040
She has inner strength.

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:17.070
But, as for me...

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:23.850
That's...

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:26.580
When—?!

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:27.840
A castle overnight?!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.160
Impossible!

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:31.070
Caesar-sama!

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:32.430
It's Oda's forces!

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:34.360
So they have come.

00:16:40.430 --> 00:16:42.270
The gauntlet has been thrown!

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:44.600
All men, advance!

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:50.370
Deployment of Takeda and Caesar 
coalition forces, confirmed.

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:53.000
In the vanguard is the 
Giant War Armor, Quo Vadis.

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:55.240
The Fool has been activated.

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:55.860
After launch,

00:16:55.860 --> 00:16:59.020
we will begin jamming the 
ley lines in this sector.

00:16:59.020 --> 00:16:59.890
Understood!

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:04.620
Let's do this for Himiko-sama!

00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:06.120
Roger!

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:12.360
Let's go!

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:14.570
It's show time, Caesar!

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:22.800
A diversion...

00:17:23.340 --> 00:17:25.230
Leave The Fool to me!

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.600
The rest of you, siege the castle!

00:17:29.740 --> 00:17:30.740
Nobunaga!

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:36.250
They're coming our way!

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:40.890
What?

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:41.500
What is that?

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.260
The castle's—?

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:53.500
They totally fell for it.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.730
The "One-Night Castle" 
plan has succeeded.

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:59.710
The night's banquet 
will finally begin.

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:02.910
Nobu, the rest is up to you.

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:05.640
You used trickery!

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:09.830
Nobunaga!

00:18:16.550 --> 00:18:18.750
Can you keep up?!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.590
He's fast!

00:18:21.590 --> 00:18:24.260
Take this!

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:26.130
I will not be defeated!

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:36.610
What?!

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:38.270
A wing-horse?!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:39.610
All right!

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:42.350
Go!

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:44.810
You're not getting away!

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:48.890
Wow, Nobu-sama!

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.850
A new Regalia power?

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:54.550
With the power of lightning 
and his new power of fire,

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:57.860
the two Regalia have 
created a completely new power.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:00.030
Go!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.670
Weak!

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:06.900
You're an amateur, Nobunaga!

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:15.180
This is the end!

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:18.580
Nobunaga!

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:35.130
Luck in battle is no ordinary luck.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:37.480
It also signifies 
how the experience

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:41.000
of being in many battles 
can lead to victory.

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:45.900
As such, my experience of having 
endured countless battles

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:49.010
will bless me with Fortuna, 
the true luck of battle.

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:50.710
Die.

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:53.950
Stop!

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:58.420
I will protect him with my own life!

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.390
Do not interfere.

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:04.290
Ranmaru!

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:07.140
Are you an idiot?!

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.540
The power of wind shall be mine!

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:17.600
May the heavens protect him!

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:26.280
What?!

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:32.640
That...

00:20:32.640 --> 00:20:34.780
is the Regalia of absolute purity!

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:38.810
The devotion of a maiden to 
Nobunaga has given rise to a new power!

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:43.460
Ah, Regalia! How profound! 
What will you show me next?

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:46.570
Come, Ranmaru!

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.020
That girl?

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:51.740
If I recall...

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:54.900
You escaped death.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:56.410
But this is the end!

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:01.200
What?!

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:02.420
Impossible!

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:13.030
I accept Shingen's wind!

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:18.490
I am Oda Nobunaga!

00:21:18.490 --> 00:21:19.790
Regalia of wind,

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:24.130
I will be your new master 
in Lord Shingen's stead!

00:21:35.550 --> 00:21:38.180
Let your rapidity be 
that of the wind!

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:48.450
Damn you, Oda Nobunaga!

00:21:52.030 --> 00:21:53.920
This is a huge victory!

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:55.900
It's thanks to your idea.

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:58.530
Call me the wise general from now on.

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:00.840
Lightning, fire, and wind.

00:21:58.530 --> 00:22:00.840
Don't get ahead of yourself, Monkey.

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:02.510
Don't call me Monkey!

00:22:01.400 --> 00:22:06.510
The Regalia and that man have 
far surpassed my expectations

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:08.930
and are resonating with the world.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:12.290
The banquet's guests 
are beginning to assemble.

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:16.430
The Ace of Wands, indeed.

00:22:17.290 --> 00:22:19.600
The torch that lights 
the darkness...

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:25.060
Nobu, how far will you go?

00:22:27.720 --> 00:22:28.730
Nobunaga.

00:22:29.260 --> 00:22:33.070
I, Ranmaru, will protect 
you with my life!

00:22:34.760 --> 00:22:36.070
It was inevitable.

00:24:12.380 --> 00:24:15.890
My Regalia, my power...

00:24:16.700 --> 00:24:18.540
I will be his equal,
and always protect him!

00:24:19.770 --> 00:24:21.700
Next time: The Moon.

00:24:22.540 --> 00:24:24.450
A light pierces the darkness.
